  "pausedInactive": "<section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto w-[26rem] space-y-3 p-3 text-xs" aria-label="Colony" data-testid="colony-panel"><div><div class="mb-1 font-semibold">Colonies</div><ul class="space-y-1"><li><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 rounded border px-2 py-1 text-left border-accent bg-accent-soft"><span class="font-semibold">Golden</span><span class="text-muted">2 pawns</span></button></li><li><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 rounded border px-2 py-1 text-left border-border hover:bg-surface-2"><span class="font-semibold">Old</span><span class="text-muted">released</span><span class="ml-auto text-warn">paused</span></button></li></ul></div><div class="flex gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-surface border border-border text-fg hover:bg-surface-2 hover:border-border-strong shadow-card h-7 px-2.5 text-xs gap-1.5 rounded-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg>Resume colony</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-muted hover:text-fg hover:bg-surface-2 h-7 px-2.5 text-xs gap-1.5 rounded-md">Release pawns</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-accent text-accent-fg hover:bg-accent-strong shadow-card h-7 px-2.5 text-xs gap-1.5 rounded-md">Resume colony</button></div><div class="space-y-1" data-testid="colony-options"><label class="flex items-center gap-2" title="A build that needs a crafting table or furnace the colony hasn't got: a pawn crafts one and places it near home"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Builds may place the benches they need</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2" title="Off: only benches you designate (inspector: Use as colony workbench) are used, never another player's"><input type="checkbox">Use any bench near home (no designation)</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2" title="Loot no chest's filter takes goes into any chest with room that doesn't deny it"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Unfiltered storage takes anything</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2" title="Off (like the genre): what a chest's filter no longer allows and no chest takes is dropped beside it"><input type="checkbox">Keep disallowed items until a chest takes them</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2" title="Last resort for a pawn stuck in a pit or a cave: teleport it home (op)"><input type="checkbox" checked="">Teleport stuck pawns home</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2" title="With nothing to do, in free hours and while resting after failures: pastimes (wander, socialise, stargaze, sit, the garden, the sunset), strolls only, or stay put">Idle pawns<select aria-label="Idle pawns" data-testid="colony-idle" class="rounded border border-border bg-surface px-1 py-0.5"><option value="recreation">recreation</option><option value="wander">wander</option><option value="stay">stay put</option></select></label></div><div class="text-muted" data-testid="colony-seats">3 of 4 pawns in game · server: 1 seat free, 0 kept for regulars</div><div class="space-y-1.5 rounded-md border border-border p-2" data-testid="colony-home"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-semibold">Home</span><span class="text-